pand your territory with bloodshed? An interstellar journey unlike any other is about to unfold.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108270/extras/7d9fa836ffe47e0e5456b2493d9630b2.poster.avif?t=1730497155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108270/extras/7d9fa836ffe47e0e5456b2493d9630b2.webm?t=1730497155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108270/extras/7d9fa836ffe47e0e5456b2493d9630b2.mp4?t=1730497155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
